Package: pulsaros-sddm
Version: 1.0.14
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: sddm, curl, gnome-session-xsession, qt6-image-formats-plugins
Description: SDDM login theme and configurations for Pulsar OS.
 Packages and configures SDDM as the default display manager using the Apple Tahoe theme.
 Sets SDDM as default while keeping gdm3 libraries to maintain GNOME screen locking.
